flowchart LR
  Q[Task or user query] --> S[Compact task state]
  S --> R[Router TRM]
  R --> M{MCP family}
  M --> F[Filesystem]
  M --> G[GitHub]
  M --> P[Postgres]
  M --> D[Play diary]
  F --> C[Candidate descriptors]
  G --> C
  P --> C
  D --> C
  C --> T[Retriever TRM]
  T --> X[Deterministic MCP executor]
  X --> V[Verifier TRM]
  V -->|exact hit| E[Compact evidence bundle]
  V -->|near miss| R
  V -->|enough evidence| L[Main LLM or policy]
  E --> L
  L --> O[Answer / action / storyworld decision]
  O --> Y[Outcome log]
  Y --> Z[TRM-MCP rows]
  Z --> R
  Z --> T
  Z --> V

  subgraph Learned pointer policy
